			"type": "text",
			"id": "t33",
			"x": 1080,
			"y": 900,
			"text": "A. Long polling [chosen]\n   + simple HTTP; cache final results\n   - held requests; reconnect overhead\n\nB. Pub/Sub → SSE / WebSocket\n   + prompt updates; fewer repeated reads\n   - connection cost; missed notifications\n   Both: read DB on reconnect / cache miss",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"width": 380.185546875,
			"height": 200,
